# ============================================================
# POWERSHELL MASTER - PÓS-FORMATAÇÃO
# Windows 10 / Windows 11 - 64 bits
#
# INCLUI:
# - Winget
# - Adobe Acrobat Reader
# - Deluge
# - Discord
# - GIMP
# - MiniTool Partition Wizard
# - MSI Afterburner
# - TeamViewer
# - WinRAR
